**Location:** [elements/ui/elements.tsx](elements/ui/elements.tsx#L17854-L18400)

**Core Components:**
1. **Scene** - Main canvas wrapper
2. **SceneInner** - Camera, controls, grid, gizmo setup
3. **Geometry** - Base mesh component with selection/hover rendering
4. **Gltf** - glTF model loader and material processor

**Scene Features:**
